--TEST PLAN
The test Plan which i have generated will throughly check each and every variable and data set of this project from End to End API formulation to Database storage.
This test plan outlines the strategy, scope, and approach for testing the Real-Time Project Management Dashboard application.
The purpose of this document is to ensure that all functionalities of the system operate correctly, reliably, and efficiently. 
The testing process will focus on verifying backend APIs, validating data handling, and ensuring smooth integration between frontend and backend components.
The primary objective of testing is to:

Verify that all APIs function as expected
Ensure correct data processing and storage
Validate integration between frontend and backend
Identify and fix errors, bugs, or inconsistencies
Confirm that the system behaves correctly under valid and invalid inputs.
--Testing Approach

The testing process will be carried out in the following stages:

.1 Unit Testing

Individual components such as controller functions will be tested independently to ensure correct logic implementation.

.2 API Testing

All backend APIs will be tested using tools like Postman to verify request handling, response accuracy, and status codes.

.3 Integration Testing

Frontend and backend interaction will be tested to ensure proper communication and data flow between both components.

.4 Error Handling Testing

The system will be tested with invalid inputs and edge cases to ensure proper error handling and meaningful responses.
As stated above each and every Module form every unit to Factions of Unit will be tested throughly so that no problem arises and the project will be of highest Quality.
After Testing the following results can be guaranteed-
All test cases pass successfully.
Authentication system works correctly.
Project and task management functionalities operate without errors.
Frontend and backend are fully integrated and functioning properly.
--CONCLUSION--
This test plan provides a structured approach to verify the functionality and reliability of the Real-Time Project Management Dashboard. Proper execution of this plan will ensure that the application meets its requirements and delivers a stable and efficient user experience.
